# Strict PR Target Policy

- Never run raw `gh pr create`.
- Always use `scripts/gh-pr-safe` for pull request creation.
- Every PR command must include `--repo jajunk/azurelinux-protagonist`.
- Never target `microsoft/azurelinux` from this clone unless the user explicitly asks and `ALLOW_UPSTREAM_PR=1` is intentionally set for that one command.
- If a command could open a PR to upstream, stop and ask for confirmation first.
